[statement]
A name nothing requires makes no preliminary choice. The walk reaches
`dq5` through `px`'s condition before it reaches `L`, and nothing requires
`dq5`: it keeps `L` from neither of its candidates, so `L` goes to `dq6`,
listed first, and nothing leads to `qt5`, whose dependency on `icu-full`
would steer `icu` away from `icu-en`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:icu X L

P:px
V:1
p:X=1
i:dq5

P:dq6
V:1
p:L=1

P:dq5
V:1
p:L=1
D:Q5

P:qt5
V:1
p:Q5=1
D:icu-full

P:icu-en
V:1
k:100
p:icu=1

P:icu-full
V:1
k:10
p:icu=1

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install icu-en 1
install px 1
install dq6 1
install app 1
